# The Array Root's coolant store with a work suit (CIPlay array_root_acidsuit, 11-11 w06; in a test world 'CI ...').
# The suit box by the door (arcoolsuits, -20.8 -29.6) gives 180 s of suit; across the spill to the locker and back
# out, unhurt, with the acid still there.
island The Array Root keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
at -21.2 -30.6 h=4.5
use arcoolsuits
expect shown arcool
walk -21.2 -30.6 to -22.75 -30 to -22.75 -27 to -22 -25 to -20.8 -23.6
wait 6
expect unhurt
open Coolant store locker
wait 2
walk -20.8 -23.6 to -22 -25 to -22.75 -27 to -22.75 -30
expect unhurt
